{"ID":"20240205164744-a3hgnv1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205164744-a3hgnv1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164744-a3hgnv1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140529-qneo2zj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165404-ytrmvvx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140529-qneo2zj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:255,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:255\u0026#125;","title":"五倍子","type":"doc","updated":"20240830114812"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140529-qneo2zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140529-qneo2zj","updated":"20240206140537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、云南、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t角倍：呈菱形或卵圆形，具不规则角状分枝，长38cm，直径25cm。表面黄色或淡黄棕色，灰白色软滑短绒毛较明显。质硬而脆，破碎后中空，壁较薄，约0.10.2cm，角质，内有多数黑褐色蚜虫尸体及灰色粉状排泄物。内壁浅棕色，平滑。剖面角质。微有特异臭气，味涩。肚倍：呈长圆形或纺锤形囊状，长2.59cm，直径1.54cm。表面灰褐色或灰棕色，微有柔毛。质硬而脆，易破碎，断面角质样，有光泽，壁厚0.20.3cm，内壁平滑，有黑褐色死蚜虫及灰色粉状排泄物。气物异，味涩。\n【性味】\t酸、涩，寒。\n【功效】\t敛肺；止汗；涩肠；固精；止血；解毒。主治肺虚久咳；自汗盗汗；久痢久泻；脱肛；遗精；白浊；各种出血；痈肿疮疖。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140529-h7q5ks8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140529-h7q5ks8","updated":"20240206140529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140529-3vj1bgb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165404-ytrmvvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165404-ytrmvvx","updated":"20240205165404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子-20240205165404-jf0spso.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830114705-xdhnmay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114705-xdhnmay","updated":"20240830114705"}},{"ID":"20240718110020-lhiep19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718110020-lhiep19","updated":"20240830114728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"角倍（出自盐肤木）"}]},{"ID":"20240709115626-jy01925","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709115626-jy01925","updated":"20240709115626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 605px;","style":"width: 595px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子-20240709115626-um81p9l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 595px;\" parent-style=\"width: 605px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 606px;","style":"width: 596px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 1-20240709115719-e7vfphn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 596px;\" parent-style=\"width: 606px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709115946-6k6pjeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709115946-6k6pjeu","updated":"20240709123803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 434px;","style":"width: 424px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 8-20240709123705-dr8csqe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 424px;\" parent-style=\"width: 434px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 765px;","style":"width: 755px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 10-20240709123803-koxrjl8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 755px;\" parent-style=\"width: 765px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709123233-crshato","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709123233-crshato","updated":"20240718105432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 372px;","style":"width: 362px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 12-20240709123928-vb040f9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 362px;\" parent-style=\"width: 372px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 493px;","style":"width: 483px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 17-20240709124935-cgjphgd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 483px;\" parent-style=\"width: 493px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 432px;","style":"width: 422px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240718105432-6kaktd5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 422px;\" parent-style=\"width: 432px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718105857-vjtdnwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718105857-vjtdnwa","updated":"20240718105920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240709124719-r8qvap8","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"盐肤木"}]},{"ID":"20240718110046-abd24qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718110046-abd24qo","updated":"20240718110046"}},{"ID":"20240718105659-s2r36sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718105659-s2r36sx","updated":"20240830114741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肚倍（出自青麸杨）"}]},{"ID":"20240718110355-491tafe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718110355-491tafe","updated":"20240718110355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 482px;","style":"width: 472px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 3-20240718110355-ebfu1bi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 472px;\" parent-style=\"width: 482px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718110512-2fmgt9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718110512-2fmgt9k","updated":"20240718110512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 4-20240718110512-lbso6we.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830104526-fcz7uio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830104526-fcz7uio","updated":"20240830104541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 1-20240718110044-vjms942.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 621px;","style":"width: 611px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肚倍"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肚倍-20240830104526-r9v9ttq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 611px;\" parent-style=\"width: 621px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718105951-ngog5mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718105951-ngog5mq","updated":"20240718110517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 738px;","style":"width: 728px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子-20240718105951-ewjoubb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 728px;\" parent-style=\"width: 738px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五倍子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五倍子 2-20240718110258-tk5e8ku.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718110519-k3bieex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718110519-k3bieex","updated":"20240830114658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref strong","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240830110031-5ecpujj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"青麸杨（青肤杨）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114615-fyjmvmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114615-fyjmvmb","updated":"20240830114615"}},{"ID":"20240718104928-45mca4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718104928-45mca4y","updated":"20240830104136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：五倍子并不是植物，而是一种蚜虫寄生在像盐肤木这类植物上面，然后刺激植物产生分泌物，形成的虫嘤。（虫瘿是植物组织遭受昆虫等生物取食或产卵刺激后，细胞加速分裂和异常分化而长成的畸形瘤状物或突起，它们是寄生生物生活的房子，瘿瘤的一种，指在植物体上由于昆虫产卵寄生引起的异常发育部分。）"}]},{"ID":"20240709124452-pkw7lke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709124452-pkw7lke","updated":"20240718105614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：五倍子有两种，像寄生在盐肤木上的，叫做‘角倍’，生长在青麸杨上的，叫做‘肚倍’，肚倍的药效比角贝好些；"}]},{"ID":"20240709124453-wehmr0f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240709124453-wehmr0f"}},{"ID":"20240830114804-7obsqc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-7obsqc0","updated":"20240830114812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：五倍子"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-slfqvlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-slfqvlo","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五倍子《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-tygwq9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-tygwq9i","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔBèiZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-cb98d8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-cb98d8c","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】GALLACHINENSIS"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-eqc9bgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-eqc9bgn","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】棓子、百药煎、百虫仓"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-6rfe7db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-6rfe7db","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为漆树科植物盐肤木RhuschinensisMill.、青麸杨RhuspotaniniiMaxim.或红麸杨Rhuspun-jabensisStew.var.sinica（Diels）Rehd.etWils.叶上的虫瘿，主要由五倍子蚜Melaphischinensis（Bell）Baker寄生而形成。秋季采摘，置沸水中略煮或蒸至表面呈灰色，杀死蚜虫，取出，干燥。按外形不同，分为“肚倍”和“角倍”。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-tt3yyti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-tt3yyti","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-mfikcjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-mfikcjg","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肚倍:呈长圆形或纺锤形囊状，长2.5～9cm，直径1.5～4cm。表面灰褐色或灰棕色，微有柔毛。质硬而脆，易破碎，断面角质样，有光泽，壁厚0.2～0.3cm，内壁平滑，有黑褐色死蚜虫及灰色粉状排泄物。气特异，味涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-bci1w9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-bci1w9u","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"角倍:呈菱形，具不规则的角状分枝，柔毛较明显，壁较薄。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-sjjjzhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-sjjjzhu","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品粉末0.5g，加甲醇5ml，超声处理15分钟，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取五倍子对照药材0.5g，同法制成对照药材溶液。再取没食子酸对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述三种溶液各2μl，分别点于同一硅胶ＧＦ254薄层板上，以氯仿-甲酸乙酯-甲酸（5:5:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，置紫外光灯（254nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材和对照品色谱相应的位置上，分别显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-mo9rxgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-mo9rxgl","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【含量测定】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-0pg2pwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-0pg2pwj","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取本品粉末（过三号筛）约2g[同时另取本品粉末测定水分（附录ⅨH第一法）]，精密称定，照鞣质含量测定方法（附录ⅩB）测定，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-jfcttln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-jfcttln","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品按干燥品计算，含鞣质不得少于50.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-oybg90u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-oybg90u","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】敲开，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-25z9b8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-25z9b8x","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸、涩，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-n0ide34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-n0ide34","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、大肠、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-a9cosj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-a9cosj7","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】敛肺降火，涩肠止泻，敛汗止血，收湿敛疮。用于肺虚久咳，肺热痰嗽，久泻久痢，盗汗，消渴，便血痔血，外伤出血，痈肿疮毒，皮肤湿烂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-96fpz2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-96fpz2n","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g；外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-spesd1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-spesd1q","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防压。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-fwhrvxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-fwhrvxu","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-0ykc47r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-0ykc47r","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五倍子《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ukvja86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ukvja86","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qfmcjq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qfmcjq7","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔBèiZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-xggt7bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-xggt7bq","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】文蛤、百虫仓（《开宝本草》），木附子（《现代实用中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-aayicxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-aayicxb","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-f49ltoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-f49ltoh","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为倍蚜科昆虫角倍蚜或倍蛋蚜在其寄主盐肤木、青麸杨或红麸杨等树上形成的虫瘿。其寄主植物分别参见\"盐麸子\"、\"膏麸杨根\"、\"红麸杨\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-v5icmlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-v5icmlr","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"角倍蚜的虫瘿，称为\"角倍\"，多于9～10月间采收；倍蛋蚜的虫瘿称为\"肚倍\"，多于5～6月间采收。如收采过时，则虫瘿开裂；影响质量。采得后，入沸水中煎3～5分钟，将内部仔虫杀死，晒干或阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-k8m0sov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-k8m0sov","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8t2b0o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8t2b0o4","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①角倍蚜"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-jex2znu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-jex2znu","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"成虫有有翅型及无翅型两种。有翅成虫均为雌虫，全体灰黑色，长约2毫米，头部触角5节，第3节最长，感觉芽分界明显，缺缘毛。翅2对，透明，前翅长约3毫米，痣纹长镰状。足3对。腹部略呈圆锥形。无翅成虫，雄者色绿，雌者色褐，口器退化。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-45pljiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-45pljiw","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本种的寄主植物为盐肤木。当早春盐肤本树萌发幼芽时，蚜虫的春季迁移蚜（越冬幼蚜羽化后的有翅胎生雌虫），便在叶芽上产生有性的雌雄无翅蚜虫，经交配后产生无翅单性雄虫，称为干母。干母侵入树的幼嫩组织，逐步形成多角的虫瘿。干母在成瘿期间，旺盛地营单性生殖，在虫瘿中产生许多幼虫，于9～10月间，逐渐形成有翅的成虫，称为秋季迁移蚜。此时虫瘿自然爆裂，秋季迁移蚜便从虫瘿中飞出，到另一寄主茶盏苔及其同属植物上，进行无性生殖，产生幼小蚜虫。此种幼蚜固定在寄主的茎上，分泌蜡质，包围整个虫体，形成白色的球状茧而越冬；至第二年春天，越冬幼蚜在茧内成长为有翅成虫，即春季迁移蚜，又飞到盐肤木上进行繁殖。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-z6zures","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-z6zures","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布四川、贵州、云南、陕西、湖北、广西、湖南、河南、甘肃、广东、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、山西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ooaxtqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ooaxtqq","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②倍蛋蚜"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zk42on5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zk42on5","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形态及生活史与上种相似，惟秋季迁移蚜的触角，第3节较第5节略短，感觉芽境界不明；虫瘿蛋形。寄主植物为青麸杨及红麸杨。分布同上种。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-55rmjcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-55rmjcw","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上两种昆虫虫瘿内的幼虫（五倍子内虫）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8fhzmi8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8fhzmi8","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-33wppll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-33wppll","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①角倍"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-18trmsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-18trmsn","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：菱倍，花倍.呈不规则的囊状或菱角状，有若干瘤状突起或角状分枝，表面黄棕色至灰棕色，有灰白色软滑的绒毛，质坚脆，中空，破碎后可见黑褐色倍蚜的尸体及白色外皮和粉状排泄物。壁厚1～2毫米，内壁浅棕色，平滑。破折面角质样。气微而特异，味涩而有收敛性。以皮厚、色灰棕、完整不碎者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-eud36wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-eud36wx","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②肚倍"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-th0lw57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-th0lw57","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：独角倍。呈纺锤形囊状或长圆形，无突起或分枝，外表毛茸较少，壁厚2～3毫米，折断面角质样，较角倍光亮。以个大、皮厚、质坚、完整者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-o0pds0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-o0pds0j","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上述药材产于四川、贵州、云南、陕西、湖北、广西等地。此外，如湖南、河南、甘肃、广东、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、山西等地亦产。以角倍的产量为大，肚倍的质量为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-xad955l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-xad955l","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】盐肤木虫瘿含大量五倍子鞣酸及树脂、脂肪、淀粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-hm9jgin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-hm9jgin","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣净、敲开、剔去其中杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-uzxeozl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-uzxeozl","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-rog8ytb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-rog8ytb","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-3tzuwk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-3tzuwk5","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》：\"味苦酸，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-1sc3kpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-1sc3kpr","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"酸咸，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-nbsssjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-nbsssjc","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草备要》：\"咸酸涩，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ma85f03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ma85f03","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zh332lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zh332lv","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-bwtkj3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-bwtkj3g","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入大肠经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-kgnwuw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-kgnwuw9","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入手太阴、足阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-7ihl30o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-7ihl30o","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入肝、肺、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-rl5hrqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-rl5hrqb","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-nzssms8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-nzssms8","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敛肺，涩肠，止血，解毒。治肺虚久咳，久痢。久泻，脱肛，目汗，盗汗，遗精，便血，衄血，崩漏，外伤出血，肿毒，疮疖，睫毛倒卷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-q8e5chh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-q8e5chh","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草拾遗》：\"治肠虚泄痢，热汤服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ml5lk9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ml5lk9b","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日华子本草》：\"治中药毒，消酒毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zt9b4zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zt9b4zz","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《开宝本草》：\"疗齿宣疳蠿，肺脏风毒流溢皮肤作风湿疮，瘙痒脓水，五痔下血不止，小儿面鼻疳疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8lcli4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8lcli4j","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草图经》：\"生律液。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-1c7lw6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-1c7lw6s","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义》：\"口疮，以末掺之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-69pmmxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-69pmmxn","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草衍义补遗》：\"菩收顽痰，解诸热病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-d77sg7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-d77sg7e","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草荤筌》：\"煎汤洗眼目，消亦目止疼，专为收敛之剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-81rx27k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-81rx27k","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《纲目》：\"敛肺降火，化痰饮，止咳嗽，消渴，盗汗，呕吐，失血，久痢，黄病，心腹痛，小儿夜啼，治眼赤湿烂，消肿毒、喉痹，敛溃疮、金疮，收脱肛、子肠坠下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-nukc5n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-nukc5n9","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《中药形性经验鉴别法》：\"用于火伤及烫伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-6tcd57b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-6tcd57b","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：研末，0.5～2钱；或入丸、散。外用：煎汤熏洗、研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-neofl6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-neofl6x","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】外感风寒或肺有实热之咳嗽及积滞未清之泻痢忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-594co5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-594co5z","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-wnk218x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-wnk218x","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治泻痢不止：五陪子一两。半生半烧，为末，糊丸梧子大。每服三十丸，红痢烧酒下，白痢水酒下，水泄米汤下。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-yzu2lgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-yzu2lgs","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治脱肛不收：五倍子末三钱，入白矾一块，水一碗，煎汤洗之。（《三因力》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-cnrzvty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-cnrzvty","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后肠脱：五倍子末掺之；或以五倍子、白矾煎汤熏洗。（《妇人良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-en66ooh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-en66ooh","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治寐中盗汗：五倍子末、荞麦面等分。水和作阱，煨熟。夜卧待饥时，干吃二、三个，勿饮茶水。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-7wfyf4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-7wfyf4n","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治自汗盗汗：五倍子研末，津调填脐中，缚定。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-dt73ujq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-dt73ujq","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治虚劳遗浊：五倍子一斤，白茯苓四两，龙骨二两。为末，水糊丸，梧子大。每服七十丸，食前用盐汤送下，日三服。（《局方》玉锁丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-sre7eyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-sre7eyi","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治消渴饮水：五倍子为末，水服方寸匕，日二服。（《世医得效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-unkpb4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-unkpb4p","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治粪后下血，不拘大人小儿：五倍子末，艾汤服一钱。（《全幼心鉴》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zt9xier","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zt9xier","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治小便尿血：五倍子末，盐梅捣和丸，梧子大，每空心酒服五十丸。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-djtj12n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-djtj12n","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治鼻出血：五倍子末吹之，仍以末同鲜绵灰等分，米饮服二钱。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-3i6ugg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-3i6ugg9","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治牙缝出血不止：五倍子，烧存性，研末敷之。（《卫生易简力》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qrkw0ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qrkw0ud","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治孕妇漏胎：五倍子末，酒服二钱。（《朱氏集验医方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-jux3nz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-jux3nz4","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治金疮血不止：五倍子，生，为细散，干贴。（《圣济总录》五倍散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-oi5aefy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-oi5aefy","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治一切肿毒：五倍子、大黄、黄柏各一两。剉，共捣罗为散，新汲水调如糊，日三、五度，涂敷患处。（《圣济总录》五倍子散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-cwyly8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-cwyly8a","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治软硬疖，诸热毒庖疮：五倍子，炒焦为末，油调，纸花贴。一方水调涂，仍入麻油数点。（《昔济方》独珍膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-vdsupak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-vdsupak","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治头疮热疮，风湿诸毒：五倍子、白芷等分。研末掺之，脓水即干。如干者，以清油调涂。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-a3b01nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-a3b01nd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治咽中悬痈，舌肿塞痛：五倍子末、白僵蚕末、甘草末等分。白梅肉捣和丸，弹子大，噙咽，其痈启破。（《朱氏集验医方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-hxcs3fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-hxcs3fd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治走马牙疳：五倍子、青黛、枯矾、黄檗等分。为末，以盐汤漱净，掺之。（《痘疹便览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-v43bax2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-v43bax2","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治聘耳：五倍子，先以绵拈干，置末半字许入耳中。（《苦济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-odox9wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-odox9wr","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治风毒上攻，眼肿庠涩痛不可忍者，或上下睑眦赤烂，浮肉瘀翳侵睛：五倍子一两，蔓荆子一两半。同杵末，每服二钱，水二盏，铜石器内煎及一盏，澄滓，热淋洗；留滓二服，又依前煎淋洗。（《博济方》神效驱风散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-os4n5zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-os4n5zv","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治阴囊湿疮，出水不瘥：五倍子、腊茶各五钱，腻粉少许。研末，先以葱椒汤洗过，香油调搽。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-4x4fg50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-4x4fg50","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治疮口不收：五倍子，焙，研末，以腊醋脚调涂四围。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-yzpjrlx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-yzpjrlx","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）治手足皲裂：五倍子末，同牛骨髓填纳缝中。（《医方大成论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-kuqbdg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-kuqbdg6","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qhj7xdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qhj7xdm","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①防治水田皮炎"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-wp218pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-wp218pu","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五倍子1斤研成细末，放入白醋8斤中溶解，在下水田前，涂抹四肢受水浸泡处，使呈一黑色保护层。如已患水田皮炎，涂抹后半至1天内，患处渗出停止，疼痛减轻。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-hnxsbkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-hnxsbkd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗盗汗"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-yyhuyik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-yyhuyik","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五倍子研成细末，每晚睡前取1～3钱用冷开水调成糊状，敷于脐窝，纱布覆盖，胶布固定。重症每晚可敷2次。一般1～3次即可生效。共观察肺结核、硅肺合并肺结核等病的盗汗患者61例，均取得不同程度的疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-vcsklrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-vcsklrk","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗宫颈糜烂"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-9izy4bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-9izy4bd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用五倍子、枯矾各等量研细末，加甘油调成糊剂，用带线的小纱布块涂药贴塞于宫颈糜烂处，12小时后取出。每周复查一次。观察18例，4例糜烂处完全光滑，14例好转。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-oi0stuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-oi0stuf","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗枕部疖肿"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8l285wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8l285wd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先剃光枕部头发，清洁消毒后拔除疖子脓栓，用五倍子粉适量与醋调成膏状敷于疖肿上，厚约2毫米。每日更换1～2次，每次换药需清洁创面。共治20例，除2例不断出现新疖外，余18例均经3～9天治愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-99pdgsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-99pdgsb","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疗睫毛倒卷"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-vtmz009","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-vtmz009","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用五倍子1两研细末，加入蜂蜜或醋适量调匀，拌成糊状。用时先洗净眼睑皮肤，然后再将适量的糊剂涂于距睑缘2毫米处，每日1次，一般连涂3～10次，可望倒睫矫正。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-y1sc51b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-y1sc51b","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥用于拔牙创止血"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-cx46go8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-cx46go8","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牙齿拔除后，如继续出血不止，可用五倍子粉末适量撒于创内（避免唾液浸入），3～5分钟内拔牙创表面即为一层黄白色薄膜所覆盖，血块凝固于薄膜之下，无须咬棉纱条压迫。上颁牙拔除，粉末撒入不易，有时须稍加压迫以促进血块凝固。试用此法于拔牙后止血54人（63只牙），止血效果均满意。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-97vmi7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-97vmi7n","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-sudneot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-sudneot","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五倍子《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-a78kkam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-a78kkam","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目拾遗》。《纲目》：五倍子，宋《开宝本草》收入草部。《嘉佑本草》移入木部，虽知生于肤木之上，而不知其乃虫所造也。肤木，即盐肤子木也。此木生丛林处者，五、六月有虫如蚁，食其汁，老则遗种，结小球于叶间，正如蛅嘶之作雀瓮，蜡虫之作蜡子也。初起甚小，渐渐长坚，其大如拳，或小如菱，形状圆长不等。初时青绿，久而细黄，缀于枝叶，宛若结成，其壳坚脆，其中空虚，有细虫如蠛蠓。山人霜降前采取，蒸杀货之，否"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-jll61e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-jll61e2","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔBèiZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-9hog2g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-9hog2g3","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】ChineseGall,ChineseNut-gall"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-xd8e7qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-xd8e7qj","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】盐麸叶上球子、文蛤、百虫仓、木附子、漆倍子、红叶桃、旱倍子、乌盐泡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qpvm1r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qpvm1r3","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-uvc0clo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-uvc0clo","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为漆树科植物盐肤木RhuschinensisMill.、青麸杨R.potaniniiMaxim.和红麸杨R.punjabensisStewardvar.sinica(Diels)Rehd.etWils.等树上寄生倍蚜科昆虫角倍蚜或倍蛋蚜后形成的虫瘿。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-229qw5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-229qw5l","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.RhuschinensisMill.[SchinusindicusBurm.；RhussemialataMurr.；R.javanicaThunb.]2.RhuspotaniniiMaxim.3.RhuspunjabensisStew.var.Sinica(Diels)Rehd.etWils.[R.sinicaDiels]"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8jd21ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8jd21ku","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：角倍于9-10月间采摘，肚倍在6月间采，如过期则虫瘿开裂。采香后，用沸水煮3-5min，杀死内部仔虫，晒干或阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-i5cg8en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-i5cg8en","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-s0srksq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-s0srksq","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.盐肤子落叶小乔木或灌木，高2-10m。小枝棕褐色，被锈色柔毛，具圆形小皮孔。奇数羽状复叶互生，叶轴及叶柄常有翅；小叶5-13，小叶无柄；小叶纸质，多形，常为卵形或椭圆状卵形或长圆形，长6-12cm，宽3-7cm。先端急尖，基部圆形，边缘具粗锯齿或圆锯，叶面暗绿色，叶背粉绿色，被白粉，叶面沿中脉疏被柔毛或近无毛，叶背被锈色柔毛。圆锥花序宽大，顶生，多分枝，雄花序长30-40cm，雌花序较短，密被锈色柔毛；花小，杂性，黄白色；雄花花萼裂片长卵形，长约1mm，花瓣倒卵状长圆形，长约2mm，开花时外卷，雄蕊伸出，花丝线形，花药卵形；雌花花萼裂片较短，长约0.6mm，花瓣椭圆状卵形，长约1.6mm；花盘无毛；子房卵形，长约1mm，密被白色微柔毛；花柱3，柱头头状。核果球形，略压扁，径约4-5mm，被具节柔毛和腺毛，成熟时红色，果核径3-4mm。花期8-9月，果期10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-51jecs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-51jecs8","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.青麸杨落叶乔木，高5-8m。树皮灰褐色，小枝无毛。奇数羽状复叶互生，叶轴圆筒形，有时在上部的小叶间有狭翅；小叶7-11，具短柄；小叶卵状长圆形或长圆状披针形，长5-10cm，宽2-4cm，先端渐尖，基部多少偏斜，近圆形，全缘，两面沿中脉被微柔毛或近无毛。圆锥花序顶生，长10-20cm，被微柔毛；苞片钻形，长约1mm，被微柔毛；花白色，径2.5-3mm；花梗长约1mm、被微柔毛；花萼外面被微柔毛，裂片卵形，长约1mm，两面被微柔毛，边缘具细睫毛，开花时先端外卷；花丝线形，长约2mm，在雌花中较短，花药卵形；花盘厚，无毛；子房球形，径约0.7mm，密被白色柔毛。果序下垂；核果近球形，直径3-4mm，密被具节柔毛和腺毛，成熟时红色；内含种子1颗。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qbc7hr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qbc7hr4","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.红麸杨落叶乔木或小乔木，高4-15m。树皮灰褐色，小枝被微柔毛。奇数羽状复叶互生，叶轴上部有狭翅；具小叶7-13，无柄或近无柄，卵状长圆形或长圆形，长5-12cm，宽2-4.5cm，先端渐尖或长渐尖，基部圆形或近心形，全缘，下面沿脉有细毛。圆锥花序顶生，长15-20cm，密被微绒毛；花小，杂性，白色；花暮裂片狭三角形；花瓣长圆形，开花时先端外卷；花丝线形；花药卵形；花盘厚，紫红色，无毛；子房球形，径约1mm，1室，花往3。果序下垂；核果近球形，略压扁，径约4mm，成熟时暗紫红色，被具节柔毛和腺毛。种子小。花期5月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-53uknj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-53uknj9","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8een5ej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8een5ej","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.生于海拔350-2300m的石灰山灌丛、疏林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-4moqb4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-4moqb4p","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于海拔900-2500m白山坡疏林或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-notytk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-notytk6","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.生于海拔460-3000m的石灰山灌丛或密林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-d5idroq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-d5idroq","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于全国各地（除新疆、青海外）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-i9n90w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-i9n90w7","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于山西、陕西、甘肃、河南、湖北、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-4t83vnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-4t83vnb","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于陕西、甘肃、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州、云南、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-f2fan22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-f2fan22","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-snkzdfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-snkzdfe","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）角倍菱形、卵圆形或纺锤形，长3-8cm，直径2-5cm，具有不规则的角状分枝。表面灰黄色或淡黄棕色，被灰白色软滑短柔毛。质硬脆，破碎后中空，断面角质状，有光泽，信壁厚1-2mm，内壁平滑，有多数黑褐色死蚜虫、黑色粉末状蚜虫卵及排泄物附着于内壁上，并时有1-2对游离于角倍中的白色丝团，丝团表面又附有多数蚜虫尸体，内壁上附有白色粉霜状或结晶状的蜡祥物。气特异，味涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-uj7yitl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-uj7yitl","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）肚倍长圆形或纺锤形，略扁，无角状分枝；表面暗灰黄绿色，有多数浅纵纹，柔毛较少；倍壁厚约3mm。以个大、完整、壁厚、色灰褐、纯净者为佳。经验认为内壁布满蚜虫者为优。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zhn5p80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zhn5p80","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别横切面：表皮细胞层，往往分化成1-3（-6）细胞的非腺毛，长70-140μm，有时长达350μm。表皮内侧为薄壁组织，薄壁细胞含有淀粉粒，直径约10μm，多已糊化，并可见少数草酸钙簇晶。内侧的薄壁组织中有外韧型维管束散生，维管束外侧有大型的树脂腔，直径可达270μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-1flvj9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-1flvj9q","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：灰绿色至灰棕色。①非腺毛众多，由1-6细胞构成，长70-350μm。②薄壁细胞含有淀粉粒，直径约10μm。③簇晶较少，直径约25μm。④导管螺纹直径10-15μm。⑤树脂腔都已破碎，树脂快散在，黄棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-zjd0q1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-zjd0q1v","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】盐肤木的瘿主含五倍子鞣质。这些鞣质包括：1，2，3，4，6-五-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（1，2，3，4，6-pen-ta-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），3-O-二没食子酰基-1，2，4，6-四-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（3-O-digalloyl-1，2，4，6-tetra-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），2-O-二没食子酰基-1，3，4，6-四-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（2-O-digalloyl-1，3，4，6-tetra-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），4-O-二没食子酰基-1，2，3，6-四-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（4-O-digal-oyl-1，2，3，6-tetra-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），2，3-O-二没食子酰基-1，4，6-三-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（2，3-bis-O-digalloyl-1，4，6-tri-O-galloyl-β-Dglucose），3-O-三没食子酰基-1，2，4，6-四-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（3-O-trigalloy-1，2，4，6-tetra-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），3，4-双-O-二没食子酰基-1，2，6-三-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（3，4-bis-O-digalloyl-1，2，6-tri-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose），2，4-双-O-二没食子酰基-1，3，6-三-O-没食子酰基-β-D-葡萄糖（2，4－bis-O-digalloyl-1，3，6-O-galloyl-β-D-glucose）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-tmxwou0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-tmxwou0","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-33rkazu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-33rkazu","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.腺细胞的蛋白质被凝固引起分泌抑制，产生粘膜干燥，神经末梢蛋白质的沉淀，可呈微弱的局部麻醉现象。鞣酸可与若干金属、生物碱或甙类形成不溶解化合物，因而用作解毒剂。过去用鞣酸治疗烧伤（可结痂以保护创面，避免外界刺激，减少疼痛及体液丧失），因有很大缺点（可结成焦痂，遮盖感染，妨碍正常组织之生长，特别是大量吸收可伤害肝脏等），现代外科已不再应用。鞣酸对正常小肠运动无甚影响，由于其收敛作用而减轻肠道炎症，故可制止腹泻。如胃肠道中有细菌、毒物等刺激因素存在，不应使用鞣酸制剂。鞣酸多少可干扰食物之吸收（沉淀蛋白质），但在小肠之碱性环境中，蛋白质可重新被释出，因此食物或饮料中含少量鞣酸是无害的，但大量时如过度饮茶，可延缓食物之吸收。更大量甚至可引起刺激、腐蚀，特别在空腹时可导致疼痛、呕吐、下泻或便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-6ok3mcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-6ok3mcc","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗菌作用：体外试验对金黄色葡萄球菌、链球菌、肺炎球菌以及伤寒、副伤寒、痢疾、炭疽、白喉、绿脓杆菌等均有明显的抑菌或杀菌作用。五倍子除鞣酸外尚含有其他抗菌有效成分，主要分布在皮部，五倍子心的煎剂无抗菌作用。五倍子煎剂对接种于鸡胚的流感甲型PR8株病毒有抑制作用，可能与其中所含鞣酸有关。100%煎剂用平板打洞法，对绿脓杆菌、痢疾杆菌、变形杆菌、大肠杆菌、伤寒杆菌、肠炎杆菌、炭疽杆菌、白喉杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌、乙型链球菌及肺炎球菌均有抑制作用，其抑菌作用不是由于鞣酸的酸性，而是因其对蛋白有凝固作用；经乙醚提出鞣质后的五倍子液仍有抗菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-gs7agb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-gs7agb1","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.解毒：鞣酸能和很多重金属离子、生物碱及甙类形成不溶性的复合物，故可用作化学解毒剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ubb9o4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ubb9o4l","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其他：鞣酸在胃肠道中难吸收，在通过胃肠道时水解成没食子酸，没食子酸无收敛作用，易被吸收并在体内分解。鞣酸在粘膜及创伤表面如被吸收过量，可导致肝小叶中心坏死。没食子酸及其酯类能抑制缓激肽（Bradykinin）对豚鼠回肠的收缩作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ndkoyh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ndkoyh1","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-xcskvc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-xcskvc1","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小鼠腹腔注射100%五倍子煎剂0.25ml，均于12小时内死亡，减少为1/10量时则未见异常。豚鼠口服煎剂20g/kg，未见异常，皮下注射后，局部发生腐烂、坏死、动物表现不安，行动迟钝，萎靡，食欲差，呼吸急促，24小时后死亡。鞣酸进入机体后几乎全被分解为棓酸（Gallicacid）与焦棓酸，极大量则可引起灶性肝细胞坏死。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-8vshr60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-8vshr60","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小鼠腹腔注射100%五倍子0.25ml，均于12小时内死亡，减少1/10量时则未见异常。五倍子鞣质按1.875mg/kg剂量给94只小鼠皮下注射??，3天内死亡72只。肠鼠口服煎剂20g/kg未见异常，而改用皮下注射??后，局部发生腐烂、坏死，动物表现不安并于24小时后死亡。鞣酸进入机体后几乎全部被分解，但极大量亦可引起灶性肝细胞坏死。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ncp0fpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ncp0fpj","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别取本品粉末0.5g，加水4ml，微热，滤过。取滤液1ml，加三氯化铁试液1滴，生成蓝黑色沉淀；另取滤液1ml，加10％酒石酸锑钾溶液2滴，产生白色沉淀。（检查五倍子鞣质）品质标志按《中华人民共和国药典》1955年版鞣质含量测定方法规定：本品含鞣质不得少于50.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-3kwqeh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-3kwqeh0","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣净、敲开、剔去其中杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-9pq87eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-9pq87eh","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸；涩；寒"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-awx4fkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-awx4fkn","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；胃；大肠；肝；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ujd9pzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ujd9pzz","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】敛肺；止汗；涩肠；固精；止血；解毒。主肺虚久咳；自汗盗汗；久痢久泻；脱肛；遗精；白浊；各种出血；痈肿疮疖"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ol4mfes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ol4mfes","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-10g；研末，1.5-6g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎汤熏洗；研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-98i99oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-98i99oe","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】外感风寒或肺有实热之咳嗽及积滞未清之泻痢忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-mxu0b6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-mxu0b6l","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.清消吹散(《冉氏经验方》)，用治单纯性口腔炎。2.玉液丹(《疡医大全》)，用治走马疳。3.金锁正元丹(《太平惠民和剂局方》)，用治真气不足，元脏虚弱，四肢倦怠，关节酸痛，头昏眩痛，目暗耳鸣，膝胫酸痛，不能久立，腰背拘急，不能俯仰，手足多冷，心胸痞闷，绕脐切痛，两肋虚胀，水谷不消，呃逆恶心，饮食减少，气促喘乏，心悸盗汗，遗精白浊等症。4.五倍子汤(《中药临床应用》)，用治胃和十二指肠溃疡。5.止痢方(《本草纲目》)用治泻痢不止。6.治脱肛方(《本草纲目》)。7.止汗方(《本草纲目》)。8.治产后肠脱方(《妇人良方》)。9.治消渴方(《世医得效方》)。10.治粪后下血方(《濒湖集简方》)。11.治牙出血方(《卫生易简方》)。12.治漏胎方(《朱氏集验医方》)。13.治金疮出血方(《圣济总录》)。14.五倍子散(《圣济总录》)，用治一切肿毒。15.独珍膏(《普济方》)，用治软硬疖，诸热毒疱疮。16.神效驱风散(《博济方》)，用治风毒上攻，眼肿痒涩痛不可忍者，或上下睑眦赤烂，浮肉瘀翳侵睛。17.治阴囊湿疮方(《圣惠方》)，用治阴囊湿疮，出水不瘥。18.敛疮方(《本草纲目》)，用治疮口不收。19.治皲裂方(《医方大成论》)，用治手足皲裂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-ntqc1di","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-ntqc1di","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-t5khlug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-t5khlug","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草拾遗》：治肠虚泄痢，熟汤服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-4o1k6qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-4o1k6qv","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《日华子本草》：治中药毒，消酒毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-bjkdnep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-bjkdnep","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《开宝本草》：疗齿宣疳NI，肺脏风毒流溢皮肤作风湿疮，瘙痒脓水，五痔下血不止，小儿面鼻疳疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-tllkv2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-tllkv2k","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草图经》：生津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-bm803yz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-bm803yz","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草衍义》：口疮，以末掺之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-drntcq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-drntcq2","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草衍义补遗》：善收顽痰，解诸热病。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-n26mpfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-n26mpfk","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草蒙筌》：煎汤洗眼目，消赤目止疼，专为收敛之剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-w9qcfwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-w9qcfwd","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《纲目》：敛肺降火，化痰饮，止咳嗽，消渴，盗汗，呕吐，失血，久痢，黄病，心腹痛，小儿夜啼，治眼赤湿烂，消肿毒、喉痹，敛溃疮、金疮，收脱肛、子肠坠下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qjotzuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qjotzuy","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《中药形性经验鉴别法》：用于火伤及烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-28w4r43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-28w4r43","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.朱震亨：五倍子，噙之善收顽痰，解热毒，佐他药尤良，黄昏咳嗽，乃火气浮入肺中，不宜用凉药，宜五倍、五味敛而降之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-4qt1srl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-4qt1srl","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《纲目》：盐麸子及木叶，皆酸咸寒凉，能除痰饮咳嗽，生津止渴，解热毒、酒毒，治喉痹、下血、血痢诸病。五倍子乃虫食其津液结成者，故所主治与之同功。其味酸咸，能敛肺止血，化痰，止渴，收汗；其气寒，能散热毒疮肿；其性收，能除泄痢湿烂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-qaa1p79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-qaa1p79","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草经疏》：五倍子，《本经》主齿宣疳NI，风湿癣疮，及小儿面鼻疳疮者，皆从外治，取其苦能杀虫，酸平能敛浮热，性燥能主风湿、疮痒脓水。五痔下血者，大肠积热也。大肠与肺为表里，肺得敛肃，则大肠亦自清宁也。藏器疗肠虚泄利；《日华子》主生津液，消酒毒；李时珍谓其敛肺降火，化痰饮，止咳嗽、消渴、盗汗，敛溃疮、金疮，收脱肛、子肠坠下者，悉假其入肺清金，收敛固脱之功耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-kie7a34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-kie7a34","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《本草求真》：五倍子，桉书既载味酸而涩，气寒能敛肺经浮热，为化痰渗湿、降火收涩之剂；又言主于风湿，凡风癣痒瘙，目赤眼痛，用之亦能有效。得非又收又散，又升又降之味乎？讵知火浮肺中，无处不形，在上则有痰结、咳嗽、汗出、口子、吐衄等症；在下则有泄痢、五痔、下血。脱肛、脓水湿烂、子肠坠下等症；溢于皮肤，感冒寒邪，则必见有风癣痒瘙，疮口不敛；攻于眼目，则必见有赤肿翳障。用此内以治脏，则能敛肺止嗽，固脱住汗，外以治肤熏洗，则能祛风除湿杀虫。药虽一味，而分治内外，用各不同，非谓既能入肺收敛，又能浮溢于表，而为驱逐外邪之药耳。书载外感勿用，义实基此。"}]},{"ID":"20240830114804-xjm209j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114804-xjm209j","updated":"20240830114814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830114805-05nitfo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830114805-05nitfo","updated":"20240830114814"}},{"ID":"20240830114806-ueb6ptz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830114806-ueb6ptz","updated":"20240830114814"}}]}